        "acc-ritual": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "show_below_gallery": true,
            "icon": "none",
            "custom_icon": "",
            "title": "The Ritual",
            "content": "<p><strong>Restore Balm + Recovery Cream · 60 ml each · one sealed set.</strong></p><p>The Ritual Duo doesn’t come apart. Not as a bundle deal, not as a starter pack — as one sealed system, formulated as a pair and sold as a pair.</p><p><strong>Step one — Restore Balm.</strong> <em>Richer · Sealing · Protective.</em> For fresh ink. Thin layer, clean dry skin, morning and night.</p><p><strong>Step two — Recovery Cream.</strong> <em>Calm · Condition · Refresh.</em> For the second stage. A lighter daily cream that sinks in fast to hydrate and soothe while the work settles — the months most people skip.</p>",
            "liquid": "",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "acc-routine": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "show_below_gallery": true,
            "icon": "none",
            "custom_icon": "",
            "title": "How to use: the night, the morning, the second stage",
            "content": "<p><strong>The night.</strong> A few hours after the session: wrap off, a gentle wash, and nothing on it. Let the skin breathe overnight.</p><p><strong>The morning after.</strong> Restore Balm, thin. Keep it thin, keep it regular, through the first days.</p><p><strong>The second stage.</strong> Recovery Cream, morning and night, through the months it takes to settle. Most people stop at week two. Don’t.</p><p><em>Always follow the aftercare your artist gives you — they know what they put in your skin.</em></p>",
            "liquid": "",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "acc-heavy": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "show_below_gallery": true,
            "icon": "none",
            "custom_icon": "",
            "title": "Heavy work — the layered protocol",
            "content": "<p>Big work is not a big version of small work. A multi-session rework over old ink, a full back, a solid black fill — the skin takes far more than a single-sitting piece ever will. Heavy work needs its own protocol.</p><p><strong>Critical stage — both, layered.</strong> Recovery Cream first, Restore Balm straight over the top.</p><p><strong>Closing stage — Restore Balm alone.</strong> Thin layer, morning and night.</p><p><strong>Second stage — Recovery Cream alone.</strong> Weeks out, step down. Daily cream, until it’s settled.</p>",
            "liquid": "",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "acc-standard": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "show_below_gallery": true,
            "icon": "none",
            "custom_icon": "",
            "title": "Built to a standard",
            "content": "<p><strong>Formulated in Australia. Proven in a working studio. Manufactured to our specification by our production partner.</strong></p><p>Every batch is tested, not claimed: heavy metals not detected · no pathogenic microorganisms · pH 6.7 measured on batch · three-year shelf life · ISO 22716 and FDA GMP held at the manufacturing site.</p><p>Both ingredient lists are published in full, on the jar and on this page. Nothing hidden behind “and other ingredients”.</p><p><em>One product. One price. No sales, no starter sizes, no half measures.</em></p>",
            "liquid": "",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
