            "custom_icon": "",
            "title": "From the founder",
            "content": "<p><em>“I’ve looked after work with everything the market sells, and most of it made promises my skin never kept. So I built the thing I could never buy.”</em></p><p>— Benny Aquilina · seventeen years under the needle · owner, Squires Ink, Surfers Paradise</p><p><a href=\"/pages/founder\"><strong>Read the full story →</strong></a></p>",
